<title>SOUTH AFRICA: BICC CAFCA yr shr slides, no div.</title>
<headline>BICC CAFCA yr shr slides, no div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(million Zimbabwe dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     30.7 loss   vs    41.7</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 nil	   vs    27.7</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   9.6 loss    vs    12.9</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   8.0 loss    vs    15.3</p>
<p>    Tax			 1.6	   vs    2.4</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   4.4	   vs    0.8 gain</p>
<p>    Turnover		  195.8	 vs    200.2</p>
<p>Full name: BICC CAFCA</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said it saw low demand for cables from manufacturing and production during the year under review.</p>
<p>It said initiatives pursued this year, including a refocussing of the business on key market sectors, meant that it was well placed to achieve growth and a return to profitability when the expected upturn in the domestic (Zimbabwe) market came.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
